{
  "scope": "Sequential fresh processes; three repetitions, rotating workload and alternating implementation order. Four server workers on CPUs0-3, unchanged client on CPUs4-7. Each case runs one private pair, 1KiB values/window16 for 8 seconds. Private control holds 8192 idle rooms without inspectors or churn. Management holds 8192 idle rooms with eight reconnect workers and two authenticated HTTP inspectors at 10ms intervals (200 requested queries/s). Small management uses 64 idle rooms with the same churn and inspector settings. Every payload, sender, FIFO, listing field/order, Close/EOF, counter and final resource is checked by the unchanged client and runner. No builds, profiling or other load tests overlap ordinary timing.",
